<span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"alone\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"X\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"alone_why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"X让对方接纳上一段已经露出的在意，再写他在接纳中放松、热切又收住，前后的因果关系更扎实。\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"lean\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"X\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"lean_why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"X依次写接纳、想更靠近、短暂失控和提前舍不得，Y的前两条都在说相处自然、逐渐放松。\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"plain\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"Y\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"plain_why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"Y的「不必时时猜测对方是不是愿意」和「怕自己显得比对方更认真」是很具体的相处顾虑，X部分措辞如「急切盖过眼下的自在」稍显修饰。\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"cover\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"X\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"cover_why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"X既有两人安心亲近的温存，也有短暂热切后的收敛和还没失去就已经酸楚，覆盖了本段珠子的主要层次。\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"lost_in_X\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">[\n        </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">{\n          </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"what\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"他担心自己显得比对方更认真，害怕两个人投入的程度不对等。\",\n          </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"X写的是不想让自己的急切破坏自在，尚未触及双方认真程度可能不一致的顾虑。\"\n        </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">}\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">],\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"lost_in_Y\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">[\n        </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">{\n          </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"what\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"对方接纳了他此前已经显露的在意。\",\n          </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"Y写出相处自然、无需猜测，却淡化了对方对他那一点主动袒露作出接纳的具体联系。\"\n        </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">},\n        </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">{\n          </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"what\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"幸福尚未失去，他已经因好时刻必然过去而感到酸楚。\",\n          </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"Y主要把舍不得放在热切缓下来之后，X那种幸福正在发生时就已经疼惜它的心理更鲜明。\"\n        </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">}\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">]\n    </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">},\n    </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">{\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"sec\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"S03\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"alone\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"Y\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"alone_why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"Y从上一段盼望以后也能如此，发展到几乎想直接询问却没问出口，再转为反复揣测，比X再次写想露出更多又收住更有新进展。\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"lean\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"Y\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"lean_why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"Y的满足、欲问又止、没有询问后的揣测各有作用，X的第二条与S02第三条、第三条与S01的隐藏需要较为重复。\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"plain\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"Y\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"plain_why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"Y具体写到想问对方能不能一直亲近却忍住，X的「没露出来的需要总让他不得彻底踏实」更像概括心理机制。\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"cover\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"Y\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"cover_why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"Y让满足中的走神、突然想说又收住的话，以及随后绕不开的疑问连成一个过程，较好对应珠子的漂浮、短促冒头与滞留。\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"lost_in_X\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">[\n        </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">{\n          </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"what\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"他曾具体地想问对方能不能一直这样亲近，忍住不</span></p></div></div></div><div class=\"contents\"></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "parent": "<div class=\"block-BQZwFn\"><span hidden=\"\" data-chatgpt-agent-turn-start=\"\"></span><div data-content-search-unit-key=\"fallback-turn-0:2:assistant\" data-chatgpt-search-unit-key=\"fallback-turn-0:2:assistant\" data-chatgpt-search-message-ids=\"26bda2c3-a413-4cdb-bfa0-bbc464f746e5 26bda2c3-a413-4cdb-bfa0-bbc464f746e5\"><h4 class=\"sr-only m-0 select-none print:not-sr-only print:mt-4 print:mb-2 print:text-xs print:leading-normal print:font-bold print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:mt-6 print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:font-normal print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:text-secondary\" data-conversation-role=\"assistant\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:sr-only\">ChatGPT said:</span><span class=\"hidden print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:inline\" aria-hidden=\"true\">ChatGPT</span></h4><div><div class=\"group flex min-w-0 flex-col\" data-chatgpt-selection-conversation-id=\"local-chatgpt:fd873af8-c541-4e6b-9625-428914e05c10\"><span hidden=\"\"></span><div data-selected-text-overlay-target=\"_r_ep_\" dir=\"auto\" data-markdown-animated=\"\" data-markdown-text-style=\"assistant-message\" class=\"MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0 AdaptiveStreaming-uuYOZc\" style=\"--markdown-link-color: currentColor;\"><div class=\"my-4 first:mt-0 last:mb-0 empty:hidden\" data-dil-source-message-id=\"26bda2c3-a413-4cdb-bfa0-bbc464f746e5\" data-chatgpt-copy-reference=\"0\" data-markdown-copy=\"contents\"><div class=\"[--entity-prose-inset:0px]\"><div hidden=\"\"></div><div class=\"relative PortalBoundary-TFj9W2 Renderer-ojZscX\" data-theme=\"light\" style=\"--puik-portal-zoom: 1;\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"DilRenderer-tB76Jj DilResponseRoot-HfQrEh Reveal-k2IWvM\" data-d-inline-reveal=\"\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-streaming-reveal=\"\" data-dil-message-id=\"26bda2c3-a413-4cdb-bfa0-bbc464f746e5\"><p class=\"TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">{\n  </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"sections\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">[\n    </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">{\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"sec\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"S01\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"alone\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"X\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"alone_why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"X从突然察觉强烈需要，到怕成为负担而只露出一点，再到既甜蜜又不敢多露，形成了更完整的起始矛盾。\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"lean\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"X\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"lean_why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"X三条分别交代欲望、克制和克制后的处境，Y的第一、三条都在描述突来的欢喜与尚未安稳，稍有重叠。\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"plain\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"X\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"plain_why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"X的怕给对方添负担、只肯露出一点很像日常心思，Y的「不知道该怎样接住」和「超出了对方愿意给予的亲近」较像加工过的心理描述。\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"cover\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"X\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"cover_why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"X的突然心热、明知想靠近却谨慎透露，以及悬而未决的亲近，尤其能接住珠子里想说重要的话却迟迟不敢说的感受。\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"lost_in_X\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">[\n        </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">{\n          </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"what\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"是对方先表现出的亲近触发了他的欢喜，他在这份暖意中稍稍放松。\",\n          </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"X主要写他自己突然意识到需要，没有明确写出对方的主动亲近以及由此产生的初步松弛。\"\n        </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">}\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">],\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"lost_in_Y\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">[\n        </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">{\n          </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"what\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"他已经让对方看见了一点自己的需要，却因为怕给对方造成负担而不敢透露更多。\",\n          </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"Y保留了怕表现得太急切，却没有保留已经部分袒露这一事实，使后面进一步显露依恋少了一个具体起点。\"\n        </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">}\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">]\n    </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">},\n    </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">{\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"sec\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"S02\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"alone\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"X\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"alone_why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"X让对方接纳上一段已经露出的在意，再写他在接纳中放松、热切又收住，前后的因果关系更扎实。\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"lean\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"X\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"lean_why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"X依次写接纳、想更靠近、短暂失控和提前舍不得，Y的前两条都在说相处自然、逐渐放松。\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"plain\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"Y\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"plain_why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"Y的「不必时时猜测对方是不是愿意」和「怕自己显得比对方更认真」是很具体的相处顾虑，X部分措辞如「急切盖过眼下的自在」稍显修饰。\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"cover\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"X\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"cover_why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"X既有两人安心亲近的温存，也有短暂热切后的收敛和还没失去就已经酸楚，覆盖了本段珠子的主要层次。\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"lost_in_X\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">[\n        </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">{\n          </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"what\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"他担心自己显得比对方更认真，害怕两个人投入的程度不对等。\",\n          </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"X写的是不想让自己的急切破坏自在，尚未触及双方认真程度可能不一致的顾虑。\"\n        </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">}\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">],\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"lost_in_Y\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">[\n        </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">{\n          </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"what\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"对方接纳了他此前已经显露的在意。\",\n          </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"Y写出相处自然、无需猜测，却淡化了对方对他那一点主动袒露作出接纳的具体联系。\"\n        </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">},\n        </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">{\n          </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"what\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"幸福尚未失去，他已经因好时刻必然过去而感到酸楚。\",\n          </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"Y主要把舍不得放在热切缓下来之后，X那种幸福正在发生时就已经疼惜它的心理更鲜明。\"\n        </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">}\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">]\n    </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">},\n    </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">{\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"sec\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"S03\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"alone\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"Y\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"alone_why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"Y从上一段盼望以后也能如此，发展到几乎想直接询问却没问出口，再转为反复揣测，比X再次写想露出更多又收住更有新进展。\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"lean\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"Y\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"lean_why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"Y的满足、欲问又止、没有询问后的揣测各有作用，X的第二条与S02第三条、第三条与S01的隐藏需要较为重复。\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"plain\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"Y\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"plain_why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"Y具体写到想问对方能不能一直亲近却忍住，X的「没露出来的需要总让他不得彻底踏实」更像概括心理机制。\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"cover\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"Y\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"cover_why\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"Y让满足中的走神、突然想说又收住的话，以及随后绕不开的疑问连成一个过程，较好对应珠子的漂浮、短促冒头与滞留。\",\n      </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"lost_in_X\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">[\n        </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">{\n          </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"what\": </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">\"他曾具体地想问对方能不能一直这样亲近，忍住不</span></p></div></div></div><div class=\"contents\"></div></div></div></div></div></div><span hidden=\"\"></span></div>"}]